# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend environment template.
#
# 1. Copy this file:  cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env
# 2. Adjust the value to match where YOUR backend is running.
#
# Never commit the real .env file (it is git-ignored).
